    "readingText": "TEXT A - PROFILE PAGE (Units 1-2 language, 58 words)\nMY PAGE - by Marisa\nHello! My name is Marisa, and I am 29 years old. I am\nfrom Aveiro. I am a student at night.\nMy family is small: my mother, Ines, and my brother,\nNuno. Nuno is tall and very funny.\nOur apartment has two bedrooms. There is a big table\nin the kitchen - my favorite place!\n\nTEXT B - STATION NOTICE (Unit 3 language, 62 words)\nCITY STATION - INFORMATION\nBuses today:\nFaro ........ nine thirty ........ eight dollars\nPorto ....... ten o'clock ........ thirteen dollars\n* The ticket office is next to door three. Card or\n  cash!\n* Is the office closed? Buy your ticket in the app.\n* The cafe is open seven to seven - turn right at\n  door one.\nGood travels!\n\nTEXT C - PERSONAL LETTER (Unit 4 + full recycling, 78 words)\nHi, Duda!\nNews from my new city! It is winter here - it is\nsnowing right now, and I am wearing my big red\njacket in the house. Ha!\nI work at the hospital now. I can't write every day -\nbut I am happy. On Saturdays I swim, and at night I\nread.\nMy cat, Mimi, doesn't like the snow. She sleeps all\nday next to my bed!\nDo you have news? Write to me!\n- Carla",
